# ---- Data -------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw downloads are normally NEVER committed: some sources (DrugBank full
# release) are licence-restricted, and all of them are large + reproducible
# from code.
#
# EXCEPTION: data/raw/drugbank.tab (TDC DDI benchmark, PyTDC 1.1.15,
# downloaded 2026-08-24, 42 MB, CC BY-NC 4.0). The agent container has no
# egress to dataverse.harvard.edu, so the file cannot be re-downloaded
# there. It is committed deliberately; see DATA_PROVENANCE.md.
# Note: the pattern must be data/raw/* — an ignored *directory* is never
# descended into, so a negation on a file inside it would not apply.
data/raw/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
!data/raw/drugbank.tab

data/processed/
data/external/
!data/processed/.gitkeep
!data/external/.gitkeep

# ---- Artefacts --------------------------------------------------------
runs/
checkpoints/
*.pt
*.ckpt
reports/figures/
reports/*.json
!reports/.gitkeep

# ---- Python -----------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
.env

# Transient run logs (regenerated by every run)
reports/*_log.txt

# External baseline implementations: cloned manually, not vendored.
external/*/
!external/README.md
